<title>USA: TENNIS-CARLSBAD WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CARLSBAD WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, California 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Toshiba Classic women's tennis tournament on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>7-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Helena Sukova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-1 6-0</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>3-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Late quarter-final</p>
<p>2-Monica Seles (U.S.) v Natasha Zvereva (Belarus)</p>
